  Breaking change: "feat!: ..." or a "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." footer.

Examples:
  gcp new feat login form      # -> branch feat/login-form
  gcp "feat: add login form"
  gcp pr --merge
  gcp release
  gcp "fix(api): handle empty response"
  gcp "docs: update install notes" README.md docs/
  gcp -i "refactor: clean up helpers"
  gcp amend forgotten-file.txt
